  "question": {
    "text": "A number equal to <math><mn>2</mn></math> times the mean and with a frequency equal to <math><mi>k</mi></math> is inserted in a data having&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> observations. If the new mean is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> times the old mean, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> is"
  },
